OL,3,ARyanair says it may freeze workers' pay
OL,4,Aand raise airfares
OL,5,
OL,6,FRyanair is considering a temporary wage
OL,7,Ffreeze for staff to pay for a sharp
OL,8,Frise in its fuel costs which have
OL,9,Fsurged following the US-Israel war with
OL,10,FIran.
OL,12,FThe carrier said it expects fuel prices
OL,13,Fto remain high "well into 2027" unless
OL,14,Fthere is a "swift resolution" to the
OL,15,Fconflict.
OL,17,FRyanair said its fuel bill is forecast
OL,18,Fto be bB,2bn (#1.6bn) higher in the
OL,19,Fshort-term and said it expects European
OL,20,Fairfares to increase to help cover the
OL,21,Fcost.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
