OL,3,ARyanair says it may freeze workers' pay
OL,4,Aand raise airfares
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it said that was unlikely to be
OL,7,Fenough and, among a number of measures,
OL,8,Fit is looking into "temporary pay
OL,9,Ffreezes". The BBC has contacted Unite,
OL,10,Fthe union which represents Ryanair
OL,11,Femployees, for comment.
